      shape = [2, 7]
      [0, 2]: "a"
      [0, 4]: "d"
      [0, 5]: "e"
      [1, 0]: "b"
      [1, 1]: "c"

  Graphically this is equivalent to doing

      [    a] concat [  d e  ] = [    a   d e  ]
      [b c  ]        [       ]   [b c          ]

